ber character with my girlfriend? He is a pirate and he is muscular, he is 180 cm, has 3 piercings in his left ear, 2 short piercings in the top of each ear, purple hair with a white ribbon tied on the right side, 3 necklaces, 2 blue collar pins, and a black coat. https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1L59jr4DIy-wtjpLaXAjTbZcuOAPbqUP6?usp=drive_link\n\nShe is a cloud puppy girl, has very big breasts, and is 162 cm. She has 3 piercings on each ear, with a star piercing on the right ear and ball piercing on the left ear. She is wearing a collar with gold chain and has 2 gold bracelets. She has a big tail with a gold chain on it. She has a gold bangle on her left leg. She has 2 stripes on each cheek, 2 on each shoulder, 2 on each arm, 2 on each leg. She has long pink nails. https://imgur.com/a/8codPOI\n\nThis is the pose. I want them to be eye level with each other like the first image with her hand on his arm. I want the man to pull the woman's chain collar. I want their faces to show clearly like the second image. The man is much bigger than the woman. The woman left bites and kisses all over the man. https://imgur.com/a/VuJB6OM .\n\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/VuJB6OM", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@cafelatteoisii/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2451715, "client_id": 2854643, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ebcd5574/uploads/origins/836fca8f-7483-4f21-8abd-5a01c91b6bfe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=506f7c649a49475ded9d19847588f155", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ebcd5574/uploads/origins/836fca8f-7483-4f21-8abd-5a01c91b6bfe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=506f7c649a49475ded9d19847588f155, https://si.imgix.net/ebcd5574/uploads/origins/836fca8f-7483-4f21-8abd-5a01c91b6bfe?bg=%23fff&auto=